    "Undergraduate Programs\nStaff & Faculty\nStudents\nAdmissions – Search\nGreen DNTU\n360 campus\nUndergraduate Programs\nLOYALTY\nRESPONSIBILITY\nCREATIVITY\nLOYALTY\nRESPONSIBILITY\nCREATIVITY\nLOYALTY\nRESPONSIBILITY\nCREATIVITY\nLOYALTY\nRESPONSIBILITY\nCREATIVITY\nLOYALTY\nRESPONSIBILITY\nCREATIVITY\nLOYALTY\nRESPONSIBILITY\nCREATIVITY\nLOYALTY\nRESPONSIBILITY\nCREATIVITY\nFaculty of Information Technology\nInformation technology (IT)\nSoftware engineering\nArtificial Intelligence (AI)\nFaculty of Communication and Design\nMultimedia\nGraphic design\nDigital Arts\nFaculty of Engineering\nElectronic engineering technology\nAutomotive engineering technology\nMachine building technology\nConstruction engineering technology\nFaculty of Technology\nNursing\nMedical laboratory techniques\nFood technology\nChemical engineering\nSpecialization in aesthetic technology\nEnvironmental technology\nFaculty of Foreign Languages\nEnglish language\nOriental studies\nChinese language\nFaculty of Economics\nBusiness administration\nTourism & hospitality management\nHotel management\nLogistics and Supply Chain Management\nAccounting\nFinance – Banking\nLearn, Learn More, Learn Forever\nDong Nai Technology University (DNTU) was founded more than 20 years ago on the strong belief that “Talented individuals are the vital force of a nation.” Our mission is to educate high-quality human resources based on technology and experiential learning; conduct applied research and transfer knowledge to meet societal needs, promote international integration, and support sustainable development. We take pride in nurturing digital citizens who are ready to embrace opportunities and confidently shape the future.\nCopyright © 2026 - DNTU\nTrong suốt hai thập kỷ xây dựng và phát triển một hành trình vẻ vang và đầy tự hào, Trường Đại học Công nghệ Đồng Nai không ngừng theo đuổi sự đổi mới sáng tạo thông qua hệ thống giáo dục toàn diện.\nLooking for a reliable resource to download, analyze, or research legendary and modern web shells?\nphpshells.net\noffers the most trusted underground archive for php shell tools, bypass scripts, file managers, and symlink shells—perfect for redteam, pentest, and cybersecurity professionals seeking the latest in web shell technology."
